            <title>[LU-20655] Fix wrong refcounting in EFA LND</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20655</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In several places EFA LND assumes that when it calls `kefalnd_launch_tx` the Tx refcount will increase and it rely on this behavior for the next steps. `kefalnd_launch_tx` doesn't always increase the refcount which can cause early release of the Tx.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
